  itemId: l32_comment_card
  displayName: A GUEST COMMENT CARD
  kind: 1
  drugType: 0
  colour: {r: 0.96, g: 0.95, b: 0.88, a: 1}
  description: a guest comment card.
  logText: "GUEST COMMENT CARD \u2014 The Dining Hall\nRoom: Lodge 11\nThank you
    for the lodge room. Truly. We drove an hour each way for nine days before a room
    came free, and my husband was falling asleep at the wheel on the way home.\nBut
    I have to ask. No Christmas dinner? Our son spent Christmas upstairs and we spent
    it down here with \"the winter menu.\" I understand it's not your holiday. It
    was ours.\nThe roast was very good. Please tell the kitchen.\n\u2014 Lodge 11"
